+FROZEN SOURCE CANDIDATE; COMPILED/TESTED HOST ONLY; PARENT SOLE DEVICE OWNER.
+Feynman final review of THIS frozen source/manifest is pending parent relay.
+
+Artifact: modules/q25-mt6358-snapshot.ko
+Vermagic7.0.0-q25-cfi-test SMP preempt aarch64. Current ADC object exports/config
+used without mutation. No new kernelImage/initrd/config/global source changes.
+
+After parent staging+hash verification and final peer-review PASS, proposed
+root commands (NOT executed by source agent):
+  insmod /tmp/q25-mt6358-snapshot.ko enable_snapshot=1 parent_name='10026000.pmic-wrapper:pmic'
+  p=/sys/bus/platform/devices/q25-mt6358-snapshot
+  cat "$p/diagnostics"
+  cat "$p/snapshot"
+  sleep 5
+  cat "$p/snapshot"
+  cat "$p/diagnostics"
+Exactly TWO snapshot reads; do not use watch/udevadm-test/cat wildcard loops.
+No PMIC I/O on load/probe, diagnostics reads, or module exit. Only root0400
+snapshot read performs the reviewed latch/release protocol. No auto-polling.
+Maximum2 attempts INCLUDING failed attempts, then inert withEDQUOT. Optional
+one-way early stop: printf '1\n' > "$p/stop" (software flag, NO PMIC write).
+CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=n: do not depend on rmmod. No boot autoload is supplied.
+
+Writes are ONLY regmap_update_bits atCON1 d0a: mask9 value1(begin), mask9
+value8(release), mask8 value0(clear). No full-word writes, reset bits preserved.
+Each latch/clear poll has20ms configured timeout,50us interval. If FG_ON is
+clear or FG clocks gated: EHOSTDOWN with ZERO writes, not enable/retry logic.
+Busy/reset-in-progress: EBUSY with ZERO writes. Failed reads return error,
+never stale measurements. Release error poisons endpoint and forbids new I/O.
+
+Snapshot reports current_ua,car_uah, rawwords,delta_counts,delta_error,samples.
+Positive current follows vendor charging convention; verify on Q25 before
+using as sign-qualified SOC input. CAR is hardware-origin counter, NOT SOC or
+remaining charge. First delta_errorENODATA; second can show adjacent delta
+if<=10sec apart. Large jumps/rollover ambiguous endpoints returnERANGE rather
+than inventing an unwrap; resets with small deltas are not detectable, hence
+this short delta is diagnostic only, not persisted charge accounting.
+At a5sec interval low termination current can quantize CAR delta to0: oneCAR
+LSB is~1095.92uAh at configured1mOhm/1.01. Use current_ua, not zeroCARdelta,
+for termination-current evidence. No CAPACITY, CHARGE_NOW or third Battery.
+
+Tests: every one of11 protocol operations fault-injected; successful release
+preserves unrelated bits; all65536 current words and2097152 signedCAR
+encodings; units, dualzero/ambiguous endpoints; delta/rollover rejection;
+FGoff/clocks gated/busy fail-closed; explicit stuck-false latch timeout and
+stuck-true clear timeout/fail-stop. Actual shared core compiled withUBSan,
+Wall/Wextra/Werror. Kernel externalmodule W1 j1 compile/link passed with no
+warnings. Checkpatch0errors,1intentional permission warning: root-only0400
+snapshot is necessary to prevent unprivileged users consuming hardware reads.
+
+Not yet FUNCTIONAL or SOC-capable. No device calls occurred in this work.
