+GPL-2.0-only source candidate, 2026-10-30. Newly scoped diagnostic module;
+not a verbatim upstream driver and not upstream merged/device tested.
+Native prior art: https://github.com/mt6768-mainline/linux
+Tree a18ebe5fa10cb495588ad82af5d105cce1f2f89f
+Roman Vivchar driver e49b661b05d528dd0bd279885b16a7c9ef43adfa
+Driver blob18b1b028327b7417d7c6b666cc5e676ed75685f9.
+MediaTek2021/Samsung2024/Roman2026 GPL driver informed register definitions,
+latch protocol and silicon conversion units; native initialization/OCV/SOC,
+thresholds/RTC/interrupt configuration were deliberately not carried over.
+Register offsets are from that commit's saved include/linux/mfd/mt6358/registers.h
+patch in ../coulomb-gauge-source-20261030/native-reference/add-commit.json.
+Only c0c,d08,d0a,d14,d16,d8a are used. No global header edits are needed.
+Vendor reference: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_xelex_mt6789
+Commit2a873a3511ee0eeead1442e60145093192a4535d
+GPL drivers/power/supply/mt6358-gauge.c:394 pre_gauge_update,429 post,
+449 reg_to_current,1798 coulomb_get; signed decoding follows vendor ones
+complement rather than the native fork's s16/twos-complement differences.
+ADC current scale381470nA, CAR108507nAh at10mOhm nominal. 1mOhm/1.01 source
+calibration gives raw_current*381470*10*1010/1000000 uA and corresponding CAR
+raw*108507*10*1010/1000000 uAh, signed64 intermediates, one final truncation.
+Exact stock DTBO635d2c85da1a631867575a0e64cb75babfda8a04935cbbd4fddf23546624ba6c
+matches archived dump; base-vendor.dts R_FG_VALUE1mOhm/CAR_TUNE_VALUE101(1.01),
+overlay has no overrides. mtk_battery.c:1564/1584 multiplies both by10 and
+copies into hw_status. This is exact stock configuration, not measured shunt.
+Stock profile0 selection and six temperature tables are documented in
+../coulomb-gauge-source-20261030/SOURCE-HANDOFF.txt andstock-profile-summary.json.
+
+MFD integration: runtime platform_device_register_full explicitly creates a
+child under the existing verified mt6397 driver; dev_get_drvdata(parent)
+provides struct mt6397_chip regmap. This substitutes a temporary manual MFD
+cell without patching/rebuilding the built-in MFD or changing the live DT.
+Only parent compatible mediatek,mt6358 and runtime chipID58/66 accepted.
+No modalias autoload, modules-load file, systemd unit, DT modification or
+power_supply registration. The module never obtains/changes regulators.
